# Menu Flow

## User resets patches via menu

Tags: menu-flow, reset

* Open the WoW on Silicon app
* Wait for app to be ready
* Select runner "CrossOver" from the runner dropdown
* Browse and select WoW folder "/tmp/test-wow"
* Click the "Setup" button
* Wait for setup to complete
* Open the options menu
* Click "Reset"
* Confirm reset action
* Verify "Setup" button is visible
* Verify runner dropdown is empty
* Verify game folder is empty

## User toggles alert visibility

Tags: menu-flow, alerts

* Open the WoW on Silicon app
* Wait for app to be ready
* Open the options menu
* Click "Show Alerts"
* Close the options menu
* Verify menu is closed
